    "m_ObjectId": "af02f980268e4e82b4f3b8b780605796",
    "m_Title": "Height Gradient",
    "m_Content": "In comparison to the leaf shader graph which uses the actual directional light, this gradient is only based on the height of the object(the trunk) since I want it not to be affected by light.",
